---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="杨常卿 · 嵌入式工程师" currentPath="/">
  <slot name="head">
    <style>
      /* ===== Hero ===== */
      .hero {
        min-height: 80vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 4rem 0;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%),
          var(--bg-primary);
      }

      .hero::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 56px 56px;
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 50%, black 20%, transparent 65%);
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 50%, black 20%, transparent 65%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

      .hero-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-light);
        border: 1px solid var(--accent-subtle);
        padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
      }
      .hero-badge .dot {
        width: 6px; height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--success);
        animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      @keyframes pulse-dot {
        0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.4); }
        50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0); }
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
      .hero .highlight {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #7c3aed);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }

      .hero .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .hero-tags {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      }
      .hero-tags .tag {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      /* ===== Status Bar ===== */
      .status-row { padding: 0 0 2rem; margin-top: -1rem; }
      .status-bar {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      }
      .status-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .status-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--success); flex-shrink: 0; }
      .status-text { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
      .status-text small { font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; }

      /* ===== Featured Card ===== */
      .featured-card {
        display: block;
        background:
          linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.02) 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 2rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .featured-card::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #7c3aed, transparent);
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.3s;
      }
      .featured-card:hover {
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: var(--accent-subtle);
      }
      .featured-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
      .featured-card .card-label {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
      }
      .featured-card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
      .featured-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
      .featured-card .card-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem; }
      .featured-card .card-footer {
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 600;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.3rem;
      }
      .featured-card .card-footer .arrow { transition: transform 0.2s; }
      .featured-card:hover .card-footer .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

      /* ===== Sections ===== */
      .section-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
      .section-header h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .section-header .section-arrow {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      .section-header .section-arrow:hover { color: var(--accent); }

      /* ===== Divider ===== */
      .home-divider {
        max-width: 80px;
        margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
        height: 2px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent-subtle), transparent);
        border: none;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 3rem 0; }
      }
    </style>
  </slot>

  <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-content fade-in-up">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        嵌入式工程师 / 研0
      </div>
      <h1>
        杨<span class="highlight">常卿</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        从学生思维到工程师思维。<br />
        专注嵌入式系统 · 无人机 · 机器人
      </p>
      <div class="hero-tags">
        <span class="tag">STM32</span>
        <span class="tag">C / C++</span>
        <span class="tag">Keil MDK</span>
        <span class="tag">UART</span>
        <span class="tag">SysTick</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/resume/" class="btn btn-primary">查看简历</a>
        <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-outline">浏览项目</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Status ===== -->
  <section class="status-row">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="status-bar fade-in delay-1">
        <div class="status-left">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          <span class="status-text">
            <small>当前阶段</small>
            研0工程化建设期 · 2026.06 – 2026.09
          </span>
        </div>
        <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.35rem 0.9rem;flex-shrink:0;">
          关于我 →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="home-divider" />

  <!-- ===== Featured Project ===== -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in delay-2">
        <h2>精选项目</h2>
        <a href="/projects/" class="section-arrow">查看全部 →</a>
      </div>
      <a href="/projects/embedded-lab/" class="featured-card fade-in-up delay-2">
        <div class="card-label">EmbeddedLab</div>
        <h3>串口命令控制 LED 系统</h3>
        <p>基于 STM32F407 的非阻塞 LED 控制系统。串口实时控制、三层模块化架构、UART 中断 + 环形缓冲区 FIFO、SysTick 非阻塞延时。</p>
        <div class="card-tags">
          <span class="tag">STM32F407</span>
          <span class="tag">C</span>
          <span class="tag">UART</span>
          <span class="tag">SysTick</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer">
          查看项目详情 <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
